  "summary": {
    "as": "Reported to House",
    "asOf": "2026-08-20",
    "date": "2026-09-10T19:53:34Z",
    "text": "Chesapeake Bay Watershed Advancement for Training, Education, Restoration, and Science (WATERS) Act\n\nThis bill reauthorizes the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration's Chesapeake Bay Office and modifies\u00a0requirements concerning the office and its activities, such as new consultation requirements. (The office partners with the\u00a0Chesapeake Bay Program\u00a0to improve the health of the Chesapeake Bay.)\n\nThe bill also provides statutory authority for\u00a0the office's\u00a0Chesapeake Bay watershed education and training program for elementary and secondary schools.\n\nFurther, the bill authorizes the office to establish a program to support coordinated management, protection, characterization, and restoration of priority Chesapeake Bay habitats and living resources."
  },
